<TITLE>Engine Control System General</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>TCCS (TOYOTA Computer Controlled System), which comprehensively controls fuel injection control (EFI), ignition timing control (ESA), throttle control (ETCS-i), VVT-i control, etc. with high precision, has been adopted to achieve high performance, high output, low fuel consumption and improved emission performance.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>CAN communication has been adopted as the method of communication with other computers.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Diagnosis (TaSCAN) and fail-safe functions are provided with consideration for serviceability and safety.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
